<p nodeId="fe44e27eeb8b4afc9b5ece98bbe3287d"><span font-size="14">页面</span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="eff80ba132f34f16a10a2abedc64ae2d">
<td colwidth="[232]" nodeId="0356b720747f4724bcc5f06734b9e83f">
<p nodeId="a7e4ae3c6fa04d69ab695f9aa598c30b"><span font-size="14">入口：</span></p>
<p nodeId="8097178168aa41c9ba0c2ba1d5687ab8"><span font-size="14">（1）规则组列表页面--&gt;生成工具；</span></p>
<p nodeId="78a2cef691cf4e07a6e2468e7143aebd"><span font-size="14">（2）规则组列表页面--&gt;某个规则组操作--&gt;生成工具；</span></p>
<p nodeId="549a5dcdc31f478eab37e65a1d93968b"><span font-size="14">（3）因子工具列表--&gt;添加因子工具</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[1019]" nodeId="893c079a2ad842fa99ce56c7aebd3145">
<p nodeId="38c550d23c4a4e09a057e332e0736db7"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/194006669/211892475?contentType=1" name="image.png" width="990" height="191" nodeId="b9014bfb823e4a599ae930b96818b924" /></p>
<p nodeId="a1a5c6a1b1f742bebcfc44a76766f6b6"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/194006669/212065647?contentType=1" name="image.png" width="768" height="263" nodeId="702d0c70f821431ebde4d4bf77769507" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="208d79046f9d49b594f4ca713a38e801">
<td colwidth="[232]" nodeId="98f64ef05acd4dc0aea3bf22dfdd02eb">
<p nodeId="f7f0c420b73e4739aa3a60dedfaaa672"><span font-size="14">创建：</span></p>
<p nodeId="333b8f1e911048f3a29001e21e47ed00"><span font-size="14">（1）填写中英文名称</span></p>
<p nodeId="0fef186b757c4e5e9c1b85db57bb9b44"><span font-size="14">（2）选择基于哪个规则组创建</span></p>
<p nodeId="53d1f5f1e12f4bda88365de6c1c29139"><span font-size="14">（3）配置因子工具必选的入参</span></p>
<p nodeId="56caa9967c66458c86267e367a397f95"><span font-size="14">⚠️</span><span color="rgb(245, 34, 45)"><span font-size="14">该入参配置不影响规则的执行，仅作为提供给使用方的展示信息，用户告知使用方想要使用该因子工具必须要提供的参数字段保证逻辑的正常执行（类似于数据接口的输入字段）</span></span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[1019]" nodeId="6b407fbdafbc4dfc8211314bb08ac05d">
<p nodeId="a18f9f6e091a421184af380d043e1d72"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/194006669/212095822?contentType=1" name="image.png" width="952" height="600" nodeId="09d54fb77d5c49518c2e879c46ef6cfc" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="6a886c653cfd40e7bc548a7e02dd9176">
<td colwidth="[232]" nodeId="408ca66f5c0c4a52afadde1ce0a120f0">
<p nodeId="8a827e8000b84cca8f6c19d0bd32f61d"><span font-size="14">创建：</span></p>
<p nodeId="94e0c23039a5436e91c043661f8775ea"><span font-size="14">（4）添加输出参数，支持添加多个</span></p>
<p nodeId="4d0dca42f805460d84e3331dccdb365d"><span font-size="14">⚠️</span><span color="rgb(245, 34, 45)"><span font-size="14">输出参数作为因子工具中规则执行逻辑结果的承载对象（类似于数据接口的输出字段）</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="5e1773f38fd64d5eb4d37259e25eda5c"><span color="rgb(51, 51, 51)"><span font-size="14">（5）设置</span></span><span font-size="14">输出参数的逻辑</span></p>
<p nodeId="f4c951a55a0e41d2bd4308fd3dd0e520"><span font-size="14">目前支持按照去重规则配置得分，类似于评分卡的逻辑实现（求和命中规则的计分项，优先级仅作为展示信息不参与计分）。</span></p>
<p nodeId="83a81cf575a24f1e979cf9dc47dbf605"><span font-size="14">默认分数为1分，用户可自定义调整</span></p>
<p nodeId="8fe382c57d78422fa7308e8fc5ad5dfa"><span font-size="14">⚠️</span><span color="rgb(245, 34, 45)"><span font-size="14">若在规则组中新增规则，默认为空需要用户手动补充新增规则的分数</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="3f38c6d2d84d45c6a4cb4605d28a5f09"><span font-size="14">(6)使用模版选择</span></p>
<p nodeId="dce768bf65a243b88c8d06110c0fb0ed"><span font-size="14">使用因子工具创建因子的时候，选择的配置模版。默认选择数字即可</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[1019]" nodeId="59b77fdf1aef49d3bc1933369f2c26a7">
<p nodeId="1f5d32c4e01342f591d2ca6f92c82e44"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/194006669/211997682?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="990" height="141" nodeId="69d6fa1e34be4ce3b8d03af6184cf6ac" /></p>
<p nodeId="62c37142e3c04300a1feec9502b2bf68"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/194006669/212141948?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="659" height="456" nodeId="b31d6041e35c41fcaaaca8b7daa16c38" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h4 nodeId="41f82eea74d541b7b51e8308d0458160">Step3:设置因子工具的共享业务方和使用业务方</h4>
